Z||000018||Cooter||02-26-2000||09:10 AM||||I have one of the offending civics. A 90 hatchback Si. I used to have a header and stainless glasspack (from a Ford Taurus!) but old age and wisdom has done away with all that loud crap. The car is reasonible quick. I have out run more cars at the stop light grand prix with the Honda than any other car I have ever had- including: 84 Z-28 with 5.0 HO and 3.73's, 73 camaro with BUILT 327 four speed and 4.11's, 280 Z and 280 ZX. I dont do that stuff much any more because I got pulled over after a PTO meeting one night racing a RX7 and late model z-28. The Rx7 and I got pulled over- it really sucked because I was ahead of the other 2 and had already backed off. They called my brother out (he is a policeman). It was SUPER embarassing! Some of the parents from the school saw me, and my brother gave me a monster lecture, and even told mom! Imagine being 30 years old and getting chewed out by your mother. Anyway, racing the civic is a No-No, even though I can still hang with some heavy hitters on highway. I hate having to be a grown up!!!!||||reg||1
